# docs/dockerhub-description.md used to be ignored, back when it was a scratch file to paste into
# the Docker Hub description box by hand. It is now the source the release workflow publishes
# from, so it has to be in the checkout — see "Sync Docker Hub description" in
# .github/workflows/docker-publish.yml. Left ignored, the page silently went stale for four
# releases while still telling people to map port 3108.
